/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  ONE tear: the isopropanol recycle, C2's overhead back to the feed mixer.
  It is DECLARED rather than discovered -- the sequential-plan contract
  (settled 2026-07-25) makes cycle DETECTION the engine's job and tear CHOICE
  the author's, and refuses an undeclared backward edge by name.  With one
  cycle there is only one honest cut, and this is it.

  Newton rather than Wegstein: acetone03 already records that Wegstein was
  DEFEATED on cavett01's real conditions while Newton took 7 iterations, and
  a loop whose recycle composition sits against an azeotrope is exactly the
  shape where a scalar acceleration misbehaves.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
tearStreams    ( ipaRecycle );
recycleSolver  Wegstein;
recycleTol     1e-6;
recycleMaxIter 120;
